      "parentMapId": null,
      "name": "The Four Continents",
      "description": "The whole cosmos on one sheet: Mount Sumeru in the middle with the sun and moon going round it, four continents in four seas, and a dragon palace under each. The eastern continent is where the monkey is born, the southern one is the Tang empire, and the western one is where the scriptures are.",
