      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-ffm-main-peak",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-ffm",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Sends Thousand-Mile Eye and Fair-Wind Ear to the Southern Gate, hears that the light came from a stone, and calls the matter closed.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-002-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-waterfall-and-crown",
      "sortKey": 20000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-ffm-waterfall",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-ffm",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Goes through the water on a dare, brings the whole troop in after him, and drops the word “stone” from his title on the spot.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-003-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-fear-of-death",
      "sortKey": 30000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-ffm-dining-hall",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-ffm",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Puts down the cup in the middle of the party and says out loud that being king of this is no use if it ends.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-004-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-raft-east",
      "sortKey": 40000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-ffm-beach",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-ffm",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Builds the raft himself, leaves the troop behind without much ceremony, and crosses two oceans over nine years without finding a teacher.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-005-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-subhuti-names-him",
      "sortKey": 50000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Kowtows before he is asked to, gives an account of himself with no family in it, and is given the name Wukong — Awakened to Emptiness.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-005-subhuti",
      "characterId": "jw-character-subhuti",
      "eventId": "jw-event-subhuti-names-him",
      "sortKey": 50001,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Tests the visitor’s origins, derives the surname Sun from the shape of the word for a monkey, and hands him the tenth generation-name in his own line.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-006-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-doors-refused",
      "sortKey": 60000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Refuses four whole disciplines to their teacher’s face because none of them answers the thing he came for.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-006-subhuti",
      "characterId": "jw-character-subhuti",
      "eventId": "jw-event-doors-refused",
      "sortKey": 60001,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Offers everything he teaches, is refused four times, and hits the boy three times on the head before walking out through the middle door.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-007-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-third-watch",
      "sortKey": 70000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Is the only one in the school who reads three blows and a hand behind the back as a time and a door.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-007-subhuti",
      "characterId": "jw-character-subhuti",
      "eventId": "jw-event-third-watch",
      "sortKey": 70001,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Finds the boy already kneeling by the bed and gives him the whole method for long life in one sitting.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-008-wukong",
      "characterId": "jw-character-wukong",
      "eventId": "jw-event-seventy-two-changes",
      "sortKey": 80000,
      "isAlive": true,
      "currentLocationMarkerId": "jw-location-subhuti-cave",
      "currentMapLayerId": "jw-map-route",
      "inventoryItemIds": [],
      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Learns the seventy-two changes to dodge three calamities, and the somersault cloud because his first attempt at flying is laughed at.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-snapshot-008-subhuti",
      "characterId": "jw-character-subhuti",
