      "inventoryNotes": "",
      "statusNotes": "Hands the relic and the stolen fungus to her own husband’s face and is left alive, chained to the pillar of the tower she helped rob.",
      "travelModeId": null
    },
    {
      "worldId": "journey-to-the-west-world",
