      "number": 2,
      "title": "Enlightened to Bodhi’s Wonderful Truth · Cutting Off the Demon, Returning to the Root",
      "summary": "Seven years of chores, a riddle answered at the third watch, seventy-two transformations, a cloud that crosses a hundred and eight thousand li — and an expulsion for showing off.",
      "status": "final",
      "targetWordCount": null,
      "wordGoal": null
    },
