      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "number": 7,
      "title": "Escaping from the Eight-Trigram Furnace · Pinned Under the Mountain of Five Phases",
      "summary": "Forty-nine days in the crucible leave him with fiery eyes and nothing else changed — until a wager on the palm of a hand ends it.",
