      "title": "The Yellow Lion Spirit Holds a Vain Rake Banquet · Metal, Wood and Earth Make Havoc at Leopard Head Mountain",
      "summary": "Two couriers frozen on a road, a banquet held in honour of a stolen rake, and its owner walking up to the table to take it back.",
