      "title": "Master and Lions Are Taught and Return to One · Robbing the Way Entangles Chan and Stills the Nine Spirits",
      "summary": "Nine mouths and six bites, a beating with willow switches, and a keeper who slept through the theft on a bottle of the wrong liquor.",
