      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-002",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "Every Door Refused",
      "description": "Seven years of sweeping, watering and carrying, and then the master offers him the gates: Method, Schools, Stillness, Action. He asks the same question at each one — will it make me live forever — and turns all four down when the answer is no. He is struck three times on the head and left alone.",
