      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "The Demon King of Havoc",
      "description": "He comes home to a burnt camp and a story: something came down from the north while he was away, took the gear and carried off the young ones. He finds the cave, splits a fistful of hair into three hundred small monkeys, kills the owner with the owner’s own blade, and brings the children home over the water.",
