      "description": "None of the dragon palace’s weapons is heavy enough — not the fork at three thousand six hundred catties, not the halberd at seven thousand two hundred. The Dragon Mother mentions the iron pillar that gauges the depth of the sea, and it lights up when he walks over to it, and shrinks to a size a hand can hold.",
