      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-003",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "Four Dragons, One Suit",
      "description": "A weapon is not a wardrobe. He sits down in the hall and refuses to leave without armour to match, so the bell and the drum bring the other three seas, and the phoenix cap, the gold chain-mail and the cloud-stepping shoes are found between them. Then he takes six demon kings as sworn brothers on the way home.",
