      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-nezha-beaten",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-004",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "Li Jing and Nezha",
      "description": "Heaven sends an expedition to the mountain. Mighty Magic Spirit’s axe breaks at the first block. Nezha takes three heads and six arms and is matched arm for arm, and then something hits him on the shoulder that he never saw, because it was a hair with a monkey on the end of it.",
