      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-great-sage-titled",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-004",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "An Office With No Duties",
      "description": "A second expedition is being argued for when the Gold Star repeats his advice with one amendment: give him the title he has written on his own banner. It is four characters and no salary and no work, and Heaven builds him a mansion beside the Peach Garden to keep him in it.",
