      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-five-phases-mountain",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-007",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "The Hand Becomes a Mountain",
      "description": "The five fingers turn to five joined peaks on the way down, and the pillar he signed was one of them. A paper of six gold characters is pasted on the summit, a local god is set to feed him iron pellets and molten copper, and Heaven names the banquet that follows the Feast for Peace.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-five-phases-mountain",
