      "id": "jw-event-sha-converted",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-008",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "The Curtain-Raising General",
      "description": "Something comes out of eight hundred li of water that will not float a feather. He was the general who raised the curtain at the throne, broken for a dropped crystal cup and knifed a hundred times a week ever since. He keeps nine skulls on a string because they are the only things the river will not sink.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-flowing-sands-river",
