      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-dragon-horse",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-008",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-age",
      "title": "The Dragon Hung in the Air",
      "description": "A dragon prince is hanging in the air waiting to be executed for burning a pearl his father was given by the court. She goes to the Jade Emperor and asks for him — not pardoned, but reassigned: the pilgrim will need something to ride, and no ordinary horse will get over the mountains ahead.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-celestial-hall",
