      "id": "jw-event-top-of-the-list",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-009",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "The Embroidered Ball",
      "description": "A scholar from Haizhou takes first place in the palace examination and is paraded through the streets for three days. On the third he passes under a tower where the chief minister’s daughter is choosing a husband by throwing a ball into the crowd, and it hits him on the head.",
