      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-edict-altered",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-010",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "Two Inches and an Hour",
      "description": "The edict comes down that afternoon with the diviner’s own figures on it, to the hour and the inch. So he moves the hour and shorts the fall by two inches to win the bet — and by the time he has finished being pleased with himself he has broken the law of Heaven in writing.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-jing-river",
