      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-the-haunting",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-010",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "The Head at the Door",
      "description": "The ghost comes nightly with the head in its hand asking for the life it was promised. Two generals stand the door in armour and it stops; then their painted likenesses are pasted up and it stops for good; and Guanyin, still lodging in the city as a shabby monk, waves it off with a willow spray.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-changan-daming-palace",
