      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-eighteen-hells",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-011",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "The Eighteen Hells and the Bridge",
      "description": "The way back runs the long way round: Back-Shade Mountain, the eighteen courts of punishment named one after another, and the Bridge of No Alternative with the river under it. He is shown all of it, and told at each stop which of the things happening below is done to whom, and for what.",
