      "id": "jw-event-liu-quan",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-011",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "Liu Quan Takes Poison",
      "description": "Back in his coffin, the emperor frees prisoners and three thousand palace women and posts a notice for someone to carry pumpkins to the Ten Kings. A man whose wife hanged herself over a gold hairpin puts the melons on his head and swallows poison, and finds her in the hall.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-underworld-hall-of-judgment",
