      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-fruit-refused",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-024",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "He Will Not Eat a Baby",
      "description": "The Great Immortal has gone up to a lecture leaving orders that the coming monk be given two manfruits, because they poured tea together five hundred years ago. The fruit is shaped like a child three days old, with limbs and a face. He backs three feet away from the tray and will not touch it, so the two boys eat both themselves.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-wuzhuang-temple",
