      "createdAt": 1788393600000,
      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-tree-toppled",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-025",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "The Tree Comes Down",
      "description": "Rather than stand there being called a thief he leaves a hair-double in his place to be shouted at, goes back to the garden, and pushes the root of a tree that has fruited thirty times in ten thousand years clean out of the earth. Every fruit on it sinks into the ground on the way down.",
