      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-036",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "Turned Away at Baolin Monastery",
      "description": "The prior looks at the ugly disciples and sends the whole party to squat in the corridor for the night. So the monkey breaks a stone lion in the courtyard into powder with one hand, and five hundred monks come out and kneel in the gateway and beg him to take the abbot’s own rooms.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-baolin-monastery",
