      "id": "jw-event-the-child-in-the-pine",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-040",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "A Child Tied in a Pine",
      "description": "Six hundred li of mountain with a red cloud sitting on it, and a boy of seven hanging roped in a pine tree crying about robbers. The monkey says at once that it is a demon and is told to be quiet; and then he is made to carry it.",
      "locationMarkerId": "jw-location-roaring-mountain",
