      "updatedAt": 1788393600000,
      "id": "jw-event-wearing-bajie",
      "chapterId": "jw-chapter-061",
      "timelineId": "jw-timeline-road",
      "title": "The Ox Wears Bajie’s Face",
      "description": "The same trick back the other way, and it works for the same reason: he is pleased with himself. He hands the fan to the brother who has come out to meet him, and the only reason he is still on the ground afterwards is a pill sewn into his collar by somebody who was expecting exactly this.",
